# Temple of Power's ruling: the red source need only have been controlled when it dealt the damage; if it dies afterwards
# the damage still counts. Bot1 cast Ojer Axonil on turn 1 (Mox Ruby, Mountain, Mox Pearl, Mox Jet); Bot2 cast Ornithopter and killed it on
# turn 2 with two Lightning Bolts, and it came back tapped and transformed as Temple of Power (CR 712.14a). Turn 3: with nothing dealt yet the Temple is refused. Bot1 evokes Fury,
# exiling Lightning Bolt: its enters trigger deals 4 to Bot2's Ornithopter and the evoke trigger sacrifices it. Fury is in
# the graveyard, and the Temple transforms.

